# Cabeceras de seguridad (OWASP ZAP). Netlify las aplica desde este archivo; mantener igual que
# scripts/zap/cabeceras.json (de ahí las toma el escaneo local) y que vercel.json en la web.
# Si la app se conecta a un servidor fuera de *.uleam.edu.ec o Render, agrégalo en connect-src e img-src.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self' data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://barometro-backend.onrender.com https://*.uleam.edu.ec; media-src 'self' data: blob:; connect-src 'self' https://barometro-backend.onrender.com https://*.uleam.edu.ec; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(self), geolocation=(self), payment=(), usb=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

/ngsw.json
  Cache-Control: no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/ngsw-worker.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/index.html
  Cache-Control: no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/manifest.webmanifest
  Cache-Control: no-cache, max-age=0, must-revalidate
